WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:08.540
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:08.540 --> 00:15.500
Towards a far, faraway place

00:28.860 --> 00:35.060
Blown by the wind, we walk on

00:35.060 --> 00:42.030
Wanting to know the reason we were born

00:42.240 --> 00:48.540
Even if a time of loss should come

00:48.540 --> 00:55.680
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

00:58.120 --> 01:05.530
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:05.530 --> 01:11.500
Towards something we can't lose

01:11.500 --> 01:19.140
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:19.140 --> 01:26.010
Towards a far, faraway place

01:34.090 --> 01:38.050
Zed... My dear Zed...

01:39.760 --> 01:44.220
Can you hear my lullaby?

01:44.870 --> 01:48.320
The sound of this wind blowing
through your hometown?

01:50.140 --> 01:55.940
And the sound of those white wings that
spurned me and carried you away?

02:00.420 --> 02:02.210
You see, Zed...

02:04.220 --> 02:06.690
This is why I love you...

02:07.360 --> 02:09.320
...and despise you!

02:13.730 --> 02:15.700
What the hell is this?

02:16.330 --> 02:19.460
What the heck's going on in my head?

02:22.770 --> 02:26.430
Episode 1
Winds of Fate

02:32.310 --> 02:36.720
If these incidents are to continue not only
on campus, but in town as well,

02:36.720 --> 02:39.690
it will sully our school's reputation!

02:40.490 --> 02:43.290
We must expel him at once!

02:43.690 --> 02:47.400
Is expulsion really the solution
to all our problems?

02:47.400 --> 02:49.730
He takes full advantage of how
easy we are on him.

02:49.730 --> 02:53.360
The way you deal with a guy like that
is to tighten the reigns on him.

02:53.800 --> 02:55.600
May I say a word?

02:56.200 --> 02:58.440
Zed does not mean any harm.

02:58.440 --> 03:02.340
I'm not sure how to explain, but he is
under the influence of something.

03:02.340 --> 03:04.780
I believe there is some reason for his behavior.

03:04.780 --> 03:07.520
Does having a reason entitle you
to do whatever you like?

03:07.520 --> 03:11.090
Even if you are childhood friends,
you can't shield him anymore.

03:11.090 --> 03:12.990
You're the student council president, aren't you?

03:12.990 --> 03:16.450
Why not think a little harder about how
this affects the school as a whole?

03:19.130 --> 03:21.530
Anyhow, let's just get a hold of him.

03:21.530 --> 03:23.800
Ruffian though he may be,
he does care about his mother,

03:23.800 --> 03:26.770
so if we keep an eye on the hospital,
he's bound to turn up before long.

03:54.400 --> 03:56.200
You again?

03:56.200 --> 03:58.600
You've made one hell of a mess.

03:58.600 --> 04:00.100
Sir...

04:00.100 --> 04:01.100
Yes?

04:01.100 --> 04:03.300
If he keeps on wreaking havoc like this,

04:03.300 --> 04:07.080
as a police officer, I simply won't
be able to overlook it.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.980
I am truly sorry,

04:08.980 --> 04:13.440
but it will cause our school a lot
of trouble if this gets out.

04:13.880 --> 04:17.490
We will fully reimburse those
involved for the damages.

04:17.490 --> 04:20.780
If you would, please keep this quiet?

04:21.520 --> 04:23.930
This is the last time that I will.

04:23.930 --> 04:25.550
Thank you very much.

04:26.830 --> 04:28.730
How about you give a little thought
to what you've done,

04:28.730 --> 04:31.200
rather than stand there all quiet, huh?

04:38.110 --> 04:42.410
Cripes, the kid's been nothing but trouble for me
since the moment I transferred to this school.

04:44.510 --> 04:45.710
I'm sorry.

04:45.710 --> 04:48.120
There's no need for you to apologize.

04:48.120 --> 04:50.080
If anyone should apologize, it's him...

04:53.450 --> 04:55.750
There'll be another meeting tomorrow.

04:56.820 --> 05:00.120
I give up, just figure out how
to deal with this quick.

05:00.800 --> 05:06.430
Sir, there is some special reason
only Zed knows about.

05:06.830 --> 05:09.540
He only smashes up things
like doors and gates.

05:09.540 --> 05:12.170
I guess he's the only one who knows why.

05:13.340 --> 05:16.240
Well, with his mother the way she is
I do feel some sympathy,

05:16.240 --> 05:20.870
but regardless of that, we'll decide how to
deal with him at the meeting tomorrow.

05:21.550 --> 05:23.550
The wind doesn't blow through this town,

05:23.550 --> 05:27.180
and the air only gets worse and
worse as it stagnates.

05:27.920 --> 05:30.390
Man, did I ever come to a hell hole...

06:27.520 --> 06:30.480
Give up, you can't get away.

06:38.490 --> 06:40.120
Whoa!
Hey!

06:45.070 --> 06:46.690
This is...

07:06.220 --> 07:09.680
You don't stop by my place to eat these days.

07:12.190 --> 07:14.300
My mom misses you.

07:14.300 --> 07:16.760
She thought maybe you didn't like her cooking.

07:19.530 --> 07:21.660
So you want something from me?

07:24.170 --> 07:26.510
Could you tell me something?

07:26.510 --> 07:29.970
What's with you breaking all
these doors and gates?

07:31.280 --> 07:32.950
What is it you want to do?

07:32.950 --> 07:34.740
Can't you tell me either?

07:35.420 --> 07:37.750
Does it have something to do
with your mother, or...

07:37.750 --> 07:39.550
It's got nothing to do with her!

07:40.350 --> 07:42.650
It doesn't have anything to do with my mom.

07:50.970 --> 07:53.000
This must be tough for you to bear.

07:53.000 --> 07:54.970
Why not at least put on a mask?

07:54.970 --> 07:56.600
Yeah, I know.

07:58.440 --> 08:00.410
To answer your question...

08:02.240 --> 08:03.880
You see...

08:03.880 --> 08:07.680
I've got this feeling that if I break doors,
I can go somewhere.

08:09.680 --> 08:14.310
I feel like there's a world beyond the door
that'd have more use for me.

08:19.090 --> 08:20.720
Zed...

08:22.860 --> 08:24.970
There was a meeting at school today.

08:24.970 --> 08:28.090
The teachers are out searching,
trying to bring you in.

08:28.840 --> 08:30.100
Listen, Zed...

08:30.100 --> 08:32.540
It'd be better if you were to go
to the school yourself.

08:32.540 --> 08:34.880
I think it might improve your
image a bit for one thing.

08:34.880 --> 08:36.940
What is improving my image
going to do at this point?

08:36.940 --> 08:39.350
But if things get any worse than this...

08:39.350 --> 08:42.080
I end up expelled and in police
custody regardless.

08:42.080 --> 08:43.250
I don't see any options there.

08:43.250 --> 08:43.750
But...

08:43.750 --> 08:45.380
Noah!
But...

08:46.050 --> 08:49.360
I want to do what I like,

08:49.360 --> 08:51.990
even if I'm still not sure what that is.

08:52.290 --> 08:54.900
Being tied down, having to grin and bear it...

08:54.900 --> 08:56.860
I can't take any more!

09:01.970 --> 09:03.770
That's just like you.

09:05.640 --> 09:07.610
Here, take this.

09:08.710 --> 09:10.580
Huh? That's...

09:10.580 --> 09:12.380
Falcon's feathers.

09:12.380 --> 09:15.320
The falcon is an incarnation
of the sky god, Horus.

09:15.320 --> 09:17.280
That makes them a symbol of freedom.

09:18.350 --> 09:20.320
Freedom...

09:20.890 --> 09:23.520
Here, happy birthday.

09:26.990 --> 09:29.960
So, you remembered, huh?

09:31.770 --> 09:33.370
Hey, Noah!

09:33.370 --> 09:34.840
You all right, Noah?!

09:34.840 --> 09:36.100
Hold on!

09:36.100 --> 09:37.900
Noah! Noah!

09:50.380 --> 09:52.750
I can't exactly say this is good.

09:52.750 --> 09:56.880
Your daily life is placing undue
strain on your body.

09:57.120 --> 09:58.960
A single day in the life of an ordinary person

09:58.960 --> 10:01.930
is the equivalent of a year or
two of aging for you.

10:02.460 --> 10:03.600
If you continue to push it,

10:03.600 --> 10:06.570
then as a physician I will not be able to give
any guarantees as to your survival.

10:08.040 --> 10:10.170
I won't be recovering from this
illness in any event.

10:10.170 --> 10:11.970
Please let me do as I like.

10:12.540 --> 10:14.670
Rather than live a long life in a hospital bed,

10:15.680 --> 10:17.110
I'd prefer do what I please.

10:17.110 --> 10:19.240
I don't mind if my life is cut short.

10:20.310 --> 10:22.110
I want to be free.

10:37.900 --> 10:40.370
Okay, fifteen minutes, that's all.

10:51.380 --> 10:53.350
Hey, Mom...

10:53.750 --> 10:56.720
Do you remember what day it is today?

10:58.920 --> 11:01.050
It's my birthday supposedly.

11:02.290 --> 11:04.760
I got this from Noah.

11:05.630 --> 11:07.750
Falcon feathers...

11:08.330 --> 11:09.960
Mom, are you...

11:11.870 --> 11:15.500
Wh..What's the matter, Mom?

11:18.040 --> 11:19.670
Feathers...

11:21.380 --> 11:24.000
White feathers...

11:24.410 --> 11:25.850
Have you remembered something?!

11:25.850 --> 11:26.850
You did, didn't you?

11:26.850 --> 11:29.820
Mom, is there something about white feathers?

11:29.820 --> 11:32.720
Does this mean you're having
the same dream as me?!

11:32.720 --> 11:33.750
Hey!

11:33.750 --> 11:35.290
Hey! Hey, Mom!

11:35.290 --> 11:37.120
I've finally got you, Zed!

11:37.120 --> 11:38.790
C'mon, now.

11:38.790 --> 11:39.790
Mom!

11:39.790 --> 11:40.360
You're coming with me!

11:40.360 --> 11:41.990
Mom!
You're coming with me!

11:56.140 --> 11:59.600
Now, stay here until we figure out
what to do with you tomorrow.

12:04.550 --> 12:06.180
Damn...

12:16.730 --> 12:18.030
Mom...

12:20.740 --> 12:22.360
Gotcha!

12:44.290 --> 12:47.420
Still got a ways to go, eh, Roya?

12:57.440 --> 13:00.240
This is a pleasant breeze.

13:12.820 --> 13:13.950
Crap!

13:13.950 --> 13:15.460
Zed...

13:15.460 --> 13:16.260
Noah?

13:16.260 --> 13:17.260
Wait there, I'll have you out right away.
Noah?

13:17.260 --> 13:18.560
Wait there, I'll have you out right away.

13:21.100 --> 13:22.600
You're a life-saver, Noah.

13:22.600 --> 13:24.720
I'm glad I made it in time.

13:25.270 --> 13:26.800
Where are you going, Zed?

13:26.800 --> 13:28.600
To my mom's hospital!

13:37.110 --> 13:39.080
Someone started that fire.

13:39.780 --> 13:42.220
I heard footsteps going away from the door!

13:42.220 --> 13:43.320
But who the heck would've...

13:43.320 --> 13:45.290
Doesn't make much of a difference who.

13:45.720 --> 13:48.520
I've decided I'm getting out of this town!

13:50.860 --> 13:53.990
Once I've rescued my mom,
I'm getting out of this town!

14:07.340 --> 14:09.140
Zed, run!

14:10.710 --> 14:12.340
Noah!

14:17.020 --> 14:20.790
You not only break out, but set fire
to the school as well, eh?

14:20.790 --> 14:22.620
That wasn't me.

14:22.620 --> 14:24.490
Before long, the police will be here too.

14:24.490 --> 14:26.290
Don't resist us, Zed.

14:27.600 --> 14:29.220
Move your ass.

14:29.960 --> 14:32.760
Why don't you make me?

14:36.400 --> 14:40.700
As Zed's homeroom teacher, I'd like
to deal with him personally.

14:41.410 --> 14:44.210
You have already fulfilled your
role in this matter.

14:44.210 --> 14:45.950
I beg to differ.

14:45.950 --> 14:49.250
I must kill that kid!

15:07.940 --> 15:11.470
I'll have to take you out now,
while you're still young,

15:11.470 --> 15:14.810
before you become a nuisance
of a shard caster.

15:14.810 --> 15:16.780
Shard caster?

15:17.010 --> 15:18.640
Die!

15:27.620 --> 15:28.760
Who are you?!

15:28.760 --> 15:30.380
Mom!

15:38.130 --> 15:41.000
As I thought... A Tuskan, are you?

15:41.000 --> 15:44.130
Shard caster bitch, where are you from?!

15:45.070 --> 15:48.700
Shard caster? What's that?

15:49.080 --> 15:50.700
Mom!

16:01.460 --> 16:03.420
I won't let you have your way!

16:09.900 --> 16:11.520
Mom!

16:12.930 --> 16:14.670
What the hell is this?

16:14.670 --> 16:16.970
I've got no idea what's going on here!

16:26.750 --> 16:29.220
So, you've finally done it.

16:30.050 --> 16:33.020
What the hell is this?

16:33.520 --> 16:35.320
What's happening?

16:46.170 --> 16:47.790
Zed...

16:59.610 --> 17:01.410
You fool! Cut it out!

17:29.310 --> 17:30.940
Zed...

17:54.900 --> 17:56.530
Ouch...

18:16.490 --> 18:18.120
Damn...

18:25.400 --> 18:27.030
Zed...

18:32.970 --> 18:35.940
Mom, where are you?

18:43.450 --> 18:45.920
What am I supposed to do now?

19:08.910 --> 19:10.540
The wind...

19:46.950 --> 19:48.740
Stop right there, Zed!

19:53.920 --> 19:56.550
This building is completely surrounded!

19:56.890 --> 19:58.360
You can't escape now!

19:58.360 --> 20:00.160
Give yourself up, Zed!

20:08.000 --> 20:09.800
Get him!

20:50.480 --> 20:52.450
Where am I going?

20:53.480 --> 20:56.280
Take me with you!

21:04.160 --> 21:07.890
Zico, I will be taking that spirit shard,

21:07.890 --> 21:10.520
along with your corpse!

21:13.000 --> 21:14.970
You mean this?

21:15.440 --> 21:17.440
This spirit shard isn't so simple

21:17.440 --> 21:21.400
that a down-and-out Zymotan
soldier could control it.

21:22.780 --> 21:24.570
Enough of your rambling!

21:38.590 --> 21:40.220
That's...

21:46.170 --> 21:47.960
Here I come, Zico!

21:49.040 --> 21:52.010
Oh dear, what a bother.

22:22.900 --> 22:24.530
The wind!

22:24.940 --> 22:27.070
The wind is blowing...

22:50.400 --> 22:54.270
I want to peak inside your heart, and find
out your feelings and expressions

22:54.270 --> 22:58.170
I see you bearing your burden alone, and don't
ask the reason for your twinkling tears

22:58.170 --> 23:01.740
I give you a shout of support without mentioning
them, between the answers I'm looking for

23:01.740 --> 23:05.870
Without obsessing or over thinking,
I feel sunbeams in the future you

23:07.580 --> 23:09.420
It feels nice, very, very much

23:09.420 --> 23:11.220
You and me, we're very, very good

23:11.220 --> 23:15.090
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:15.090 --> 23:16.920
Very, very much, whenever

23:16.920 --> 23:18.760
Very, very good, not changing

23:18.760 --> 23:24.720
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

23:30.240 --> 23:32.710
I feel this kindness amidst my doubt

23:34.010 --> 23:36.480
I will always have faith in you at all times

23:37.740 --> 23:41.650
Here in this vast landscape
under the sunny blue sky

23:41.650 --> 23:45.780
We got good feelings, good social standing,
we're good; I want to always be here

23:47.250 --> 23:49.060
It feels nice, very, very much

23:49.060 --> 23:50.890
You and me, we're very, very good

23:50.890 --> 23:54.690
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:54.690 --> 23:56.560
Very, very much, whenever

23:56.560 --> 23:58.430
Very, very good, not changing

23:58.430 --> 24:04.390
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

24:15.550 --> 24:19.980
Next Time
A New World

24:16.680 --> 24:19.720


Next time, "A New World"
